From c3cfd3a03f90fd974960280e0194d5ec6ee0b07c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lizhi Hou <lizhi.hou@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 1 May 2025 10:32:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] qemu: drm based accelerator backend

Add drm based accelerator backend which uses libvxdna library
to:
* enquire capset
* context management
* resource blob management
  * supports buffer allocation both either VM guest or host
* CCMD executable

QEMU compilation option:
 --enable-drm-accel

Qemu executation option:
buffer with guest memory:
-device virtio-accel-pci,accel-node=accel0

buffer with host memory:
-device virtio-accel-pci,accel-node=accel0,blob=true,hostmem=8G

Signed-off-by: Lizhi Hou <lizhi.hou@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Wendy Liang <wendy.liang@amd.com>
Co-authored-by: Wendy Liang <wendy.liang@amd.com>
Change-Id: I6ed96df5929c7f3018d13087c32a459e9314223c
(cherry picked from commit cc4d21e7c930fa55315d14c76d12bc36a1f06910)
